// Title: Standard User In High Privileged Group
// ID: 7ac407cc-0f48-4328-aede-de1d2e6fef41
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2023-01-13
// Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.privilege-escalation
// Description: Detect standard users login that are part of high privileged groups such as the Administrator group
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((EventID = "300" AND TargetUserSid startswithCIS "S-1-5-21-" AND (SidList containsCIS "S-1-5-32-544" OR SidList containsCIS "-500}" OR SidList containsCIS "-518}" OR SidList containsCIS "-519}")) AND NOT (((TargetUserSid endswithCIS "-500" OR TargetUserSid endswithCIS "-518" OR TargetUserSid endswithCIS "-519"))))
